{"id":"vod_bf_19146","vodId":"19146","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"浪客剑心","name_cn":"浪客剑心","date":"1996-01-01","year":"1996","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-20/95766dbc5267ae1a2436ff03be4f5d03.jpg"},"summary":"明治维新时期，敌我双方为了各自的理想和目标而奋勇厮杀。在此期间，名人志士不断涌现：大久保利通、木户孝允、坂本龙马、冲田总司。维新一派为了推动新时代的到来，不惜采取暗杀的手段，而绯村剑心正是众多刺客的中的一员。孤儿出身的绯村师从比古清十郎学习飞天御剑流剑法，年轻气盛的下山参战，在奇兵队中崭露头角。凭借一身的本领，绯村最终成为令幕府一派闻风丧胆的刽子手拔刀斋，同时他也和宿敌壬生狼斋藤一有过无数次对决。　　明治政府建立后，绯村收起屠刀，成为一名腰挂逆刃刀的浪人。在流浪途中，他结识了神谷道场的继承人阿薰、东京府士族后代明神弥彦以及原赤报队成员相乐左之助。在一次次的战斗中，他们的友情不断加深，绯村那颗满是血污的心灵也慢慢得到净化……　　本片根据同名漫画改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 18:01:49","playable":true,"episodeCount":94,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/langkejianxin/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/202410072bkcF68aindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241007UoMtSKWeindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/langkejianxin/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/langkejianxin/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241007xuSViqmxindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241007BeGONNuUindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241007eXTz5M8findex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241007jcCOxSIvindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241007mddbUXx9index.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241007ka22JbjRindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第1